
---

### `.gitignore`

```gitignore
# =========================
# OS / system files
# =========================
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# =========================
# IDE / editors
# =========================
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# =========================
# Python
# =========================
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
*.pyd
.python-version

# Virtual environments
venv/
.venv/
env/
ENV/

# Jupyter
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Packaging / build
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
pip-wheel-metadata/

# Test / cache / coverage
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.tox/
.nox/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/

# Logs
*.log

# =========================
# C / C++ / CMake
# =========================
bin/
obj/
out/
cmake-build-*/
CMakeFiles/
CMakeCache.txt
compile_commands.json
Makefile
*.o
*.obj
*.so
*.a
*.dll
*.exe

# =========================
# Temporary / generated data
# =========================
*.tmp
*.temp

# Великі або динамічно згенеровані дані
*.txt
*.csv
*.json

# За потреби залишайте важливі приклади вручну:
#!data/example.csv
#!config/example.json

# =========================
# Misc
# =========================
.cache/
tmp/
temp/